---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base description="Wellseed Global is a Christ-centred impact movement developing people, building sustainable resources and using them to make a difference. A Kingdom Impact Movement.">
  <section class="hero on-navy" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">A Christ-centred impact movement</span>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Funding Kingdom work. <em> Transforming lives.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Through empowerment, entrepreneurship and wealth creation, we are building people and resources to support God's work and bring meaningful change to the world through Christ.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/vision">Our Vision</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/get-involved">Join the movement</a>
        </div>
        <p class="tagline">A Kingdom Impact Movement</p>
      </div>
      <svg class="hero-art" viewBox="0 0 440 440" role="img" aria-label="Wellseed Global logo">
        <circle cx="220" cy="220" r="200" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-opacity=".35" />
        <circle cx="220" cy="220" r="160" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".12" />
        <circle cx="220" cy="220" r="125" fill="#1c3a5c" />
        <rect x="112" y="112" width="216" height="216" rx="30" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-opacity=".5" transform="rotate(45 220 220)" />
        <!-- Your logo (from public/images/logo-vector.svg) -->
        <g transform="translate(220 222) scale(0.118) translate(-1049 -905)">
          <path d="M 243,708 284,717 326,736 360,762 393,799 449,886 795,1465 839,1391 1029,1056 1041,1038 1142,1226 1167,1267 1202,1316 1241,1361 1268,1386 1311,1417 1349,1437 1396,1453 1454,1460 1492,1458 1539,1447 1583,1427 1623,1399 1636,1387 1656,1363 1678,1323 1690,1285 1693,1261 1693,1234 1685,1189 1677,1166 1664,1140 1645,1111 1630,1093 1596,1061 1551,1029 1496,1000 1423,974 1382,966 1425,991 1493,1045 1530,1083 1554,1117 1574,1157 1585,1198 1587,1240 1580,1277 1571,1298 1555,1321 1537,1338 1516,1351 1496,1359 1469,1365 1439,1366 1405,1362 1359,1347 1314,1321 1271,1285 1239,1250 1213,1215 1172,1150 1024,890 1010,911 846,1194 838,1204 628,810 604,772 581,747 557,729 540,720 524,714 494,708 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-rule="evenodd" />
          <path d="M 856,708 910,722 948,737 995,767 1026,796 1056,834 1083,876 1228,1131 1261,1182 1296,1229 1338,1273 1384,1307 1429,1327 1455,1332 1421,1312 1387,1275 1359,1230 1342,1188 1329,1139 1321,1082 1323,1004 1332,953 1350,892 1375,833 1411,768 1455,704 1511,640 1543,611 1581,585 1584,581 1635,555 1611,557 1578,565 1520,588 1486,609 1453,633 1434,649 1404,680 1376,715 1375,719 1351,752 1332,785 1300,858 1282,926 1276,917 1274,909 1247,854 1218,808 1199,785 1175,762 1150,743 1119,726 1088,715 1048,708 Z M 1852,344 1807,345 1746,352 1675,366 1617,383 1562,404 1504,432 1451,464 1415,491 1373,530 1346,561 1324,592 1299,641 1286,682 1280,720 1279,757 1282,788 1286,806 1302,747 1320,705 1340,668 1368,629 1391,602 1442,555 1466,537 1513,508 1553,488 1596,470 1684,444 1764,431 1766,433 1760,477 1741,542 1712,599 1680,644 1651,676 1602,718 1548,755 1468,805 1433,833 1392,878 1385,891 1431,871 1557,830 1599,814 1661,783 1717,743 1754,707 1783,670 1800,642 1824,590 1839,543 1851,479 1855,426 1855,384 Z" fill="#EDB96D" fill-rule="evenodd" />
        </g>
        <circle cx="220" cy="22" r="9" fill="#C5A46D" />
        <circle cx="404" cy="260" r="6" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6" />
        <circle cx="52" cy="318" r="12" fill="#C5A46D" fill-opacity=".8" />
        <path d="M60 130a170 170 0 0 1 120-90" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2 id="about-title">Who We Are</h2>
      <p class="lead">Wellseed Global is a Christ-centred movement committed to funding God's Kingdom work and transforming lives through Christ.</p>
      <p>We believe that Christians can do more than give from what they have today. They can be empowered spiritually, financially and through entrepreneurship to build businesses, create wealth and develop resources that can support God's work and help people in need.

Our desire is to build people who can create lasting resources and use them to spread the love of Christ, support churches and make a difference in communities.</p>
      <p><a class="textlink" href="/about">Learn More About Us <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section vm on-navy" aria-labelledby="vm-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Vision &amp; Mission</span>
        <h2 id="vm-title">Our Purpose and Direction.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-grid">
        <article class="vm-card">
          <h3>Our Vision</h3>
          <p>To see Kingdom work adequately supported and lives transformed through Christ, reaching churches, communities and people in need.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="vm-card">
          <h3>Our Mission</h3>
          <p>To empower people spiritually and financially, equipping them to build businesses, create wealth and develop resources that can fund God's work and transform lives.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="more"><a class="textlink" href="/vision">Read The Full Vision &amp; Mission <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="emp-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="emp-head">
        <span class="status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Where Our Work Begins</span>
        <h2 id="emp-title">Empowering People for Kingdom Impact</h2>
        <p class="lead">We are starting by developing people who can build resources to support God's work and transform lives. Through spiritual growth, financial education, business learning and practical skills, we aim to equip young Christians to become capable of creating and managing resources for a greater purpose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6c4-1.5 7-1 10 1 3-2 6-2.5 10-1v16c-4-1.5-7-1-10 1-3-2-6-2.5-10-1z" /><path d="M14 7v16" /></svg></div>
          <h3>Spiritual Growth</h3>
          <p>Growing in faith, building godly character and understanding God's Word.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10" /><path d="M17.5 10.5c-.8-1.2-2-1.5-3.5-1.5-2 0-3.5 1-3.5 2.5s1.5 2.2 3.5 2.5 3.5 1 3.5 2.5S16 19 14 19c-1.6 0-2.9-.5-3.6-1.7M14 7v2m0 10v2" /></svg></div>
          <h3>Financial Education</h3>
          <p>Learning how to earn, manage and grow money responsibly, with a clear purpose.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="22" height="15" rx="2" /><path d="M9 25h10M14 20v5" /><path d="M10 11l-2 2.5 2 2.5M18 11l2 2.5-2 2.5" /></svg></div>
          <h3>Skills &amp; Development</h3>
          <p>Building useful digital, professional and entrepreneurial skills.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="#C5A46D" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 22h20" /><path d="M6 22V12l8-6 8 6v10" /><path d="M11 22v-6h6v6" /></svg></div>
          <h3>Business &amp; Entrepreneurship</h3>
          <p>Understanding how to build businesses and create opportunities.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="emp-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/empowerment">Explore Our Empowerment Initiative</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mission" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
    <div class="wrap mission-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Be Part of the Mission</span>
        <h2 id="mission-title">Join us in making a lasting impact</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-body">
        <p class="lead">Wellseed Global brings young Christians together to build a shared purpose. Whether you want to be empowered, develop your abilities and build resources to support God's work, or you already have knowledge, skills and resources to empower others, there is a place for you in this mission.</p>
        <p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/get-involved">Join the Movement</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="how-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">How It Works</span>
        <h2 id="how-title">Four Steps Towards The Mission.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>Learn about Wellseed Global, its Christian foundation, and its vision & mission</p></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Connect</h3><p>Express your interest and get connected. Learn how you can participate and where you can contribute.</p></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Grow and Empower Others</h3><p>Participate in learning, spiritual growth and empowerment activities.</p></li>
        <li class="step"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Impact Lives</h3><p>Use the knowledge, skills, and resources you build to support God's work, churches and people in need.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="how-link"><a class="textlink" href="/get-involved">Join the movement <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
